# Daughter of a Knight (WotG 10). Amaura in Southern San d'Oria at status 0: 935; finished: status 1. At status 1: 936,
# finished: Option 1; then Amaura plays her DefaultActions event 642 (no finish change). A trade of the Cernunnos Bulb:
# 937, finished: status 2, the bulb kept. The Humus-rich Earth in Jugner Forest [S] at status 2:
# IDEAL_PLACE_TO_PLANT_ITEM; the bulb traded: planted and taken, status 3, YOU_PLANT_ITEM. At status 3:
# ITEM_IS_PLANTED_HERE there; Amaura plays 938 once per zone, then 642 (DefaultActions). The earth in Jugner Forest: 33
# (the warp to Jugner Forest writes Mission[10][6]diggingZone=114, another log's var), finished: status 4. At status 4
# the earth sends DRAWN_UNWANTED_ATTENTION; again: SENSE_UNUSUAL_PRESENCE (the trace shows neither the spawn nor the
# local var Cernunnos's script sets); Cernunnos killed: the earth plays 34, finished: the Cernunnos Resin and status 5.
# At status 5 the earth: DELIVER_TO_AMAURE; Amaura: 939, finished: the resin taken, status 6, the Timer and mustZone.
# Amaura then plays 940 (its finish sets mustZone again, already set by 939, so the trace shows no change), then 642
# (DefaultActions); after a zone change, with the Timer not reached: 940 once more (finished: mustZone again, which the
# zone change had cleared); a Vanadiel day on and a zone change: 941, finished: the mission completes (the Bottle of
# Treant Tonic, A Spoonful of Sugar current).
lists SouthernSanDoria/Amaura/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Amaura/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/935 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/936 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/937 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/939 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/940 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/941 JugnerForestS/Humus-rich_Earth/onTrigger JugnerForestS/Humus-rich_Earth/onTrade JugnerForest/Humus-rich_Earth/onTrigger JugnerForest/onEventFinish/33 JugnerForest/onEventFinish/34 JugnerForest/Cernunnos/onMobDeath
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=-84.367,-6.949,91.148 job=WAR lvl=99
item CernunnosBulb
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg DaughterOfAKnight current
login
trigger Amaura                          # status 0: 935
finish                                  # status 1
trigger Amaura                          # status 1, Option 0: 936
finish                                  # Option 1
trigger Amaura                          # Option 1: Amaura's DefaultActions 642
finish-if-event
trade Amaura CernunnosBulb x1           # 937
finish                                  # status 2; the bulb kept
warp -510.535,7.568,289.283 JugnerForestS
trigger Humus-rich_Earth                # status 2: IDEAL_PLACE_TO_PLANT_ITEM
trade Humus-rich_Earth CernunnosBulb x1 # planted; status 3
trigger Humus-rich_Earth                # status 3: ITEM_IS_PLANTED_HERE
warp -84.367,-6.949,91.148 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Amaura                          # status 3: 938, once per zone
finish-if-event
trigger Amaura                          # the second time: DefaultActions 642
finish-if-event
warp -510.535,7.568,289.283 JugnerForest
trigger Humus-rich_Earth                # status 3: 33
finish                                  # status 4
trigger Humus-rich_Earth                # status 4: DRAWN_UNWANTED_ATTENTION
trigger Humus-rich_Earth                # again: SENSE_UNUSUAL_PRESENCE
kill CERNUNNOS
trigger Humus-rich_Earth                # defeated: 34
finish                                  # the resin; status 5
trigger Humus-rich_Earth                # status 5: DELIVER_TO_AMAURE
warp -84.367,-6.949,91.148 SouthernSanDoria
trigger Amaura                          # status 5: 939
finish                                  # status 6; the Timer and mustZone
trigger Amaura                          # mustZone, amauraOption 0: 940
finish
trigger Amaura                          # amauraOption 1: DefaultActions 642
finish-if-event
warp -84.367,-6.949,91.148 SouthernSanDoriaS
warp -84.367,-6.949,91.148 SouthernSanDoria                # zoned
trigger Amaura                          # the Timer not reached: 940
finish-if-event
wait vana=24
warp -84.367,-6.949,91.148 SouthernSanDoriaS
warp -84.367,-6.949,91.148 SouthernSanDoria                # zoned
trigger Amaura                          # 941
finish                                  # completed
